resentativeness":0.9327260255813599,"text_excerpt":"Great venue for live music, not so great for food and drinks. You might want to grab a bite and pregame before you get here. Love the feel and vibes from house of blues and hob Nola hits the spot. I've seen multiple shows here and the sound is fantastic but get ready to stand the whole night. There are some seats in the balcony of those are available for you. If you get the chance to go to the foundation room GO! It is laid back, and unique not your typical bar. I've been here for concerts and rehearsal dinners and the food was excellent in the foundation room."},{"business_id":"GIo6CTonm96GbnHqLsw04g","review_id":"vAR3Bdqh6MY0cneQLMYI3A","date":"2018-07-26T09:20:28","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9266939759254456,"text_excerpt":"I like this place a lot. I haven't hung out downstairs yet. I always get the seated tickets upstairs and have gone to about 10 concerts now and it's been a blast so far. The food and drink service is not too bad either. It's a pretty good deal too and the venue setup is awesome for listening to your favorite artists - it's more up close and personable than big venues like sports stadiums. Overall, I have had great experiences so far."},{"business_id":"GIo6CTonm96GbnHqLsw04g","review_id":"J2y-zTdipsV0bE9bobIQ3A","date":"2012-02-05T14:52:20","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9263765811920166,"text_excerpt":"So being from Houston I was expecting this large, commercialized concert venue and when I got inside I was pleasantly surprised at the intimacy of the venue. They have some awesome shows here and the space is pretty sweet. You can really see the performers or bands from any angle of the venue either in the front, back by the bar or of course above with the rich folk. So far I've seen Keb Mo and a Burlesque show and immediately bought tickets to additional shows after the first one I saw here. The place is easy to get to if you want to venture downtown but steer clear of the French Quarter which is important to me as well. The sound system is solid and the size of this venue really makes s..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"GIo6CTonm96GbnHqLsw04g","photo_id":"gQsZrO3iUrebFhmQg5uN6A","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/gQsZrO3iUrebFhmQg5uN6A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.857389509677887},{"business_id":"GIo6CTonm96GbnHqLsw04g","photo_id":"LotgMFCFQi9t4Ju8xsUujQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/LotgMFCFQi9t4Ju8xsUujQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8542528748512268},{"business_id":"GIo6CTonm96GbnHqLsw04g","photo_id":"BusSkPSfz4a0y6PwieAtyA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/BusSkPSfz4a0y6PwieAtyA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8322218656539917},{"business_id":"GIo6CTonm96GbnHqLsw04g","photo_id":"fHyKBXen-zjcp8p4-ZS03Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/fHyKBXen-zjcp8p4-ZS03Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8302576541900635},{"business_id":"GIo6CTonm96GbnHqLsw04g","photo_id":"MYImfA2sd9n5B321O1rqqQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/MYImfA2sd9n5B321O1rqqQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7374624013900757}]},"notebook_case":null}
